{"lyrics":"[00:11.90]Earl on the beat\n[00:12.40]Runnin' up bands, got my guap up\n[00:15.02]All the bad hoes wanna top us\n[00:17.94]Too many wild parties on the yacht\n[00:20.56]Me and Boat got kicked out the yacht club\n[00:22.98]Ayy, ayy, air it out\n[00:26.96]Pull up at your spot, and I air it out\n[00:29.94]Gang on the gas and it's very loud\n[00:32.58]Stop sayin' my name before you wear it out\n[00:36.08]I been sippin' lean, tryna slow me down\n[00:39.12]I need me a bitch that'll hold me down\n[00:41.98]Gang comin' strong, yeah we rollin' out\n[00:45.36]Throw a party like Rollin' Loud\n[00:48.16]Ayy, don't come unless she stay in focus\n[00:50.92]Soldiers at 10-4, sent your bitch the info\n[00:53.90]Feelin' real blessed with Juice, that's my kinfolk\n[00:56.90]Bless up, she tell me I'm a god, get on her knees for confession\n[01:00.68]Sent a vid to her nigga, had to teach a lesson\n[01:03.30]Me and Boat only want bad hoes in our section\n[01:06.70]Juice, why these pussy ass niggas always pressin'?\n[01:09.38]I don't know, let 'em talk, I'ma go get my Smith & Wesson\n[01:12.68]Blessed boys under 21, steady flexin'\n[01:15.72]I'm gettin' too rich, can't do flights with connections\n[01:18.58].40 on my hip, I won't fight, bitch I'm reckless\n[01:21.68]Codeine what I sip, that shit come in straight from Texas\n[01:24.70]Reach for my chain, you'll get beat just like Nexus\n[01:27.70]Lamborghini dreams, but you still drive a Lexus\n[01:30.76]I'm a young king, I might fuck Alexis Texas\n[01:33.58]But I ain't on no Drake shit, I won't get her pregnant\n[01:37.10]Damn, young Juice WRLD, boy, you reckless\n[01:40.14]And I feel you, until I get her naked\n[01:43.12]When I get up in it, I might have to stay in\n[01:45.94]Well if she goin' like that, let's run a train then\n[01:48.46]Fuck, I think I nutted in her, I might need a playpen\n[01:52.12]And a stroller\n[01:53.60]How I get this deep? We rode her like a Rover\n[01:56.58]No games, but I XBOX control her\n[01:59.36]She do the gang like a nerd doin' homework\n[02:02.20].40 in my pants, that bitch thought it was a boner\n[02:05.24]If I go broke, I'ma juug off Motorolas\n[02:08.10]But now I'm up in France, Lil Boat, that's my mans\n[02:11.02]We get the green and then we fly around like Peter Pan\n[02:13.96]That's cool, but I just thought 'bout somethin', wait\n[02:16.00](What?)\n[02:16.26]This baby got your face\n[02:17.70]So fuck that lil' baby, boy's back to the place\n[02:20.98]Back to the trap, back to the gang\n[02:23.96]Runnin' up bands, got my guap up (Runnin' the guap up)\n[02:27.42]All the bad hoes wanna top us (They wanna top us)\n[02:29.94]Too many wild parties on the yacht (Ohh-oh)\n[02:32.56]Me and Boat got kicked out the yacht club (Out the yacht club)\n[02:40.58]Ohh-oh-oh\n[02:40.88]Listen here, be alright\n[02:43.20]Shit hard","words":[[11.9,11.96,"Earl"],[12.0,12.06,"on"],[12.12,12.18,"the"],[12.26,12.32,"beat"],[12.4,12.54,"Runnin'"],[12.58,12.6,"up"],[12.7,13.0,"bands,"],[13.1,13.16,"got"],[13.22,13.24,"my"],[13.44,14.16,"guap"],[14.64,14.94,"up"],[15.02,15.08,"All"],[15.14,15.2,"the"],[15.32,15.56,"bad"],[15.7,16.0,"hoes"],[16.08,16.26,"wanna"],[16.42,17.16,"top"],[17.3,17.58,"us"],[17.94,18.16,"Too"],[18.32,18.58,"many"],[18.72,18.98,"wild"],[19.06,19.44,"parties"],[19.56,20.0,"on"],[20.04,20.1,"the"],[20.2,20.44,"yacht"],[20.56,20.66,"Me"],[20.76,20.9,"and"],[20.98,21.26,"Boat"],[21.34,21.54,"got"],[21.66,21.96,"kicked"],[22.04,22.18,"out"],[22.24,22.32,"the"],[22.46,22.72,"yacht"],[22.84,22.92,"club"],[22.98,23.18,"Ayy,"],[23.24,25.28,"ayy,"],[25.5,26.0,"air"],[26.08,26.18,"it"],[26.24,26.44,"out"],[26.96,27.08,"Pull"],[27.14,27.28,"up"],[27.34,27.44,"at"],[27.48,27.54,"your"],[27.58,27.86,"spot,"],[28.1,28.22,"and"],[28.38,28.38,"I"],[28.52,29.02,"air"],[29.08,29.18,"it"],[29.42,29.46,"out"],[29.94,30.32,"Gang"],[30.38,30.48,"on"],[30.62,30.66,"the"],[30.7,31.02,"gas"],[31.1,31.2,"and"],[31.24,31.34,"it's"],[31.44,32.04,"very"],[32.18,32.54,"loud"],[32.58